# The build context is the repo root, because the image needs `web/src` as well
# as `render`. That makes an accurate ignore list load-bearing rather than
# tidy: without it, Docker uploads every node_modules in the tree and the
# builder's own `pnpm install` is then racing a stale copy of itself.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.data
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
api
docs
scripts
